			JEST FOR KIDS 11-17-10
		Riddles and Puns for the 8 to 14 year old

			RIDDLES

What would happen if you swallowed a frog?
    You might croak.

Why did the fool get fired from the M & M factory?
    He kept throwing out the W's.

Who styles Bugs Bunny's fur?
    A Hollywood hare dresser.

Why was night baseball started?
    Because bats like to sleep in the daytime.

What did one elevator say to the other elevator?
    "I think I'm coming down with something."

Canadian police are now using snakes to discover explosives being =
smuggled into the country. What is the name given to these vipers?
    Mountie Pythons

			SCHOOL WORK

